# {{label|en|baseball}} The player that squats behind [[home plate]] and receives the pitches from the [[pitcher]]
# {{label|en|chiefly|US|colloquial}} The [[bottom]] partner in a [[homosexual]] [[relationship]] or [[sexual]] [[encounter]] between two men.

